# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout, regardless of a developer's
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, checking out worker-configuration.d.ts
# on a Windows machine with autocrlf=true converts it to CRLF, which makes
# `wrangler types --check` (LF-only comparison) report it as out of date on
# every fresh checkout/worktree - including the one Sandcastle creates for
# its sandbox runs.
* text=auto eol=lf
